The CIDOC-CRM definitions `ceist vocab ontology` reads labels and scope notes from.

cidoc_crm_v6.2.xml      CIDOC CRM v6.2 (draft) in RDFS, by FORTH-ICS (2015), with Arches'
                        edits (the "Human-Made" class names the graphs' ontologyclass URIs use)
CRMsci_v1.2.3.rdfs.xml  CRMsci 1.2.3 in RDFS, by FORTH-ICS (2016): O-codes such as O18i

Both copied unchanged from arches-her (github.com/archesproject/arches-her, commit 9f6a113,
arches_her/pkg/ontologies/cidoc_crm/), the ontology the HER graphs were built against;
its ontology_config.json names cidoc_crm_v6.2.xml as base, version 6.2.

